    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d185">

                <pb facs="0594" n="536" sameAs="frus:frus1866p3/pg536"/>

                <head>Mr. Burton to Mr.
                        Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 243.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States</hi>,
                                <hi rendition="#italic">Bogota</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1866-06-07"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi>
                            7, 1866.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Appearances, so far, indicate that the
                    administration of General Mosquera will fail to bring to the country the repose
                    so anxiously looked for, and thus rescue it from the sad condition described in
                    my No. 197. The close of <pb facs="0595" n="537" xml:id="pg537"/> President
                    Murillo’s term found the nation greatly demoralized, and general discontent and
                    painful apprehension seem to have taken possession of the public mind since. The
                    belief is very general among the best judges of events in this unfortunate
                    country, that it will soon be again in a state of civil war; perhaps within a
                    few months. Numerous recent signs tend to confirm the reasonableness of this
                    fear.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>ALLAN A. BURTON.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, Washington, D. C</hi>.</p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
